{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overkill Squad</strong> is a fast-paced twin-stick shooter roguelike with explosive action, dark humor, and a heart-pumping heavy rock/metal soundtrack.<br>You command a squad of mercenary animals armed with absurdly heavy weapons. Whatever the job is, the Overkill Squad does it a hundred times louder\u2014and leaves a trail of destruction everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different: fight through procedurally generated levels, face waves of grotesque monsters, clash in over-the-top boss fights, and collect powerful relics to push your luck further. Choose your squad members wisely\u2014each animal brings unique abilities and special powers. Thanks to the wide variety of relics, unique character traits, and absurd weaponry, countless creative builds and combinations are possible\u2014no two runs ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense twin-stick shooting with heavy metal energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A driving rock/metal soundtrack that fuels the chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive arsenal of weapons for endless playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters, each with their own traits and fighting style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels filled with enemies, traps, and destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal boss battles that push your skills to the limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic system offering endless build variety through synergies with characters and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, unforgiving action </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re ready for chaos, carnage, and absurdity, join the <strong>Overkill Squad</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955160?t=1757660323","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/87219fff75996230e46914bdd0e57fe18de15629/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757660323","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/a681b8e60bfc26f22e37d873a0d61530e7cd9121/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757660323","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/a681b8e60bfc26f22e37d873a0d61530e7cd9121/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757660323","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4020440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overkill Squad</strong> is a fast-paced twin-stick shooter roguelike with explosive action, dark humor, and a heart-pumping heavy rock/metal soundtrack.<br>You command a squad of mercenary animals armed with absurdly heavy weapons. Whatever the job is, the Overkill Squad does it a hundred times louder\u2014and leaves a trail of destruction everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different: fight through procedurally generated levels, face waves of grotesque monsters, clash in over-the-top boss fights, and collect powerful relics to push your luck further. Choose your squad members wisely\u2014each animal brings unique abilities and special powers. Thanks to the wide variety of relics, unique character traits, and absurd weaponry, countless creative builds and combinations are possible\u2014no two runs ever feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense twin-stick shooting with heavy metal energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A driving rock/metal soundtrack that fuels the chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive arsenal of weapons for endless playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters, each with their own traits and fighting style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels filled with enemies, traps, and destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal boss battles that push your skills to the limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relic system offering endless build variety through synergies with characters and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, unforgiving action </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re ready for chaos, carnage, and absurdity, join the <strong>Overkill Squad</strong>.</p>","developers":["Chillfox Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955160/e7d2a6fcda4d38e11bae158602b085efa3d2b590/header.jpg?t=1757660323","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257187359,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187359/movie480.mp4?t=1756230404","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187359/movie_max.mp4?t=1756230404"},"name":"Overkill Squad \u2013 Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187359/e12903d991fa28f68fd11ce269759043b9aff725/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756230404","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187359/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756230404","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187359/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756230404"}}],"name":"Overkill Squad","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Chillfox Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\